# --- ResourceSpace upstream code (kept on disk as reference, not tracked) ---
# We forked from RS r28830 (ADR 0001) and reverse-engineered a clean-room
# Go rewrite (ADR 0006). The strangler-fig porting layer was abandoned
# (ADR 0003 historical); RS is now blueprint / reference only. Local copies
# stay so we can compare against upstream when designing replacements;
# `./scripts/rs-diff.sh` syncs them to current RS HEAD. Never tracked again.
/batch/
/css/
/dbstruct/
/documentation/
/gfx/
/iccprofiles/
/include/
/js/
/languages/
/lib/
/pages/
/plugins/
/upgrade/
/tests/
/templates/
/api/
/.well-known/
